75-i20240322","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-208975","date":"2024-03-22","original_code":"747.3203(14)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","severity_rank":2,"source_category":"Medium High","status":"corrected","status_label":"Corrected at inspection","finding":"Using, Storing and Disposing of Hazardous Materials: Cleaning supplies were in an unsecured lower cabinet under the sink. Pesticides were unsecured in a lower cabinet under the fish tank.  This was corrected at inspection when all items were removed.","topic":"safety","source_record_id":"1026522935","facility_name":"Thuy Khuc"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-945929-i20240124-v7","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-747-3203-14","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-945929-i20240124","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-945929","date":"2024-01-24","original_code":"747.3203(14)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","severity_rank":2,"source_category":"Medium High","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-02-06","finding":"Using, Storing and Disposing of Hazardous Materials: Cleaning supplies and other household items such as bath wash and lotions were stored in a cabinet underneath  the bathroom sink. Pictures were taken.","topic":"safety","source_record_id":"1026433250","facility_name":"Tnt Learning Academy"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1363336-i20240118-v7","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-747-3203-14","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1363336-i20240118","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-1363336","date":"2024-01-18","original_code":"747.3203(14)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","severity_rank":2,"source_category":"Medium High","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-01-31","finding":"Using, Storing and Disposing of Hazardous Materials: There was cleanings supplies accessible to children in the kitchen and under the bathroom sink.     There was fecal matter in multiple areas of the backyard.     This was corrected when the cleaning supplies were moved and the bathroom cabinet was locked